  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "My matches"
 },
 "description": "For the signed-in buyer: the notified matches of the latest completed assessment, or of the assessment named by assessment_id, best score first, each as a masked card with its score and tier. On a review account the cards are its matches, and no vendor is contacted. A vendor's contact details appear only on a match that vendor has accepted, with the requirement and preference credits that vendor earned for you and the status of each certification you required; every other card stays masked. Buyers pay nothing, and no card carries pricing. The result carries a summary sentence: relay it to the user in your own words, and treat a count of zero as a normal state, not a problem.",
 "icons": [
  {
   "mimeType": "image/x-icon",
   "sizes": [
    "16x16",
    "32x32"
   ],
   "src": "https://app.preshiftiq.com/favicon.ico"
  },
  {
   "mimeType": "image/png",
   "sizes": [
    "64x64"
   ],
   "src": "https://app.preshiftiq.com/icon.png"
  }
 ],
